{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The plan is taking shape as a 1–2 player expedition through four authored caves: learn to read danger, use arrows to scout and lure as well as fight, open terrain routes with recovered tools, then face two distinct guardians. I’ll specify the ammo and fog rules, multiplayer authority, save behavior, and completion tests so the builder can carry it through to a finished slice.\n"}}
