preserve the encounter's  [... omitted end of long line]\n330:| Survival | One hit per attack; damage immunity interval; solo death; co-op revive; expired revive; simultaneous wipe costs one reserve; zero reserves; checkpoint restores enemy/ammo state together | [... omitted end of long line]\n332:| Saves and settings | Reload at every major checkpoint; corrupted/unsupported save handling; storage denial; isolated dev/attract/Hub state; music default and persisted user override; resetting live  [... omitted end of long line]\n367:Populate **Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, and Prompt Feedback** in both the final chat response and the in-game About/Credits screen. Preserve every required metadata field and [... omitted end of long line]\n369:Source Information must cover date, source, plan, genre/perspective, actual tech versions, art direction, animation, code-only audio, network modes, allowed testing and performed research, environment [... omitted end of long line]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
